  REPLY QR RD RA NXDOMAIN
  SECTION QUESTION
    hop.sub.example. IN A
  SECTION ANSWER
    hop.sub.example. 3600 IN CNAME lost.org.
  SECTION AUTHORITY
    . 300 IN SOA root. nobody.invalid. 1 7200 3600 86400 300
